  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0011_ddaa88f3ab02.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.84028in;height:2.02708in\" /><br />Circle circumscribes the triangle <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and has center at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.<br /><math><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> radius of circle, <math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Thus, equation of circle is <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
